+/*
+ * Multi-instance libretro frontend for mGBA.
+ *
+ * This is deliberately a separate frontend rather than a change to the
+ * regular libretro core. One libretro core still presents one video/audio
+ * stream to RetroArch; this frontend owns up to three mCore instances and
+ * composites those streams horizontally.
+ */
+
